  "releaseNotes": "Release 2.2.0: OCR Feature Documentation and Visibility Enhancement\n\n✨ New Features:\n• Enhanced OCR capabilities documentation with comprehensive use cases\n• Improved README highlighting Tesseract 5.2.0 + SkiaSharp integration\n• Better visibility of image processing features for developers\n\n🔧 Technical Improvements:\n• Updated package metadata with accurate project URLs\n• Enhanced documentation showcasing OCR as key differentiator\n• Improved user guidance for image-based document processing\n\n📚 Documentation Updates:\n• Comprehensive OCR feature documentation with real-world examples\n• Enhanced README with detailed image processing capabilities\n• Added use cases for scanned documents, receipts, and image content\n• Highlighted WebP to PNG conversion and multi-language OCR support",
